operation emitEscCode
input operation emitEscCode code CNullTerminatedByteString
output operation emitEscCode CSignedInt32
effect emitEscCode write console.stdout
authority emitEscCode write console.stdout
memory emitEscCode heap no
async emitEscCode no
purpose operation emitEscCode "Emit one ANSI escape sequence body after ESC."
invariant operation emitEscCode "The ESC byte is always emitted before the supplied ANSI body."
label startEmitEscCode
call escapeCall c.putchar
argument escapeCall character CSignedInt32 escapeByte
run escapeCall
ignore value source escapeCall type CSignedInt32
call codeCall c.printf
argument codeCall format CNullTerminatedByteString code
run codeCall
ignore value source codeCall type CSignedInt32
return value zeroI32

